@page "/"

<PageTitle>BlazorSync render modes</PageTitle>
<h1>One notes component, every render mode</h1>
<p>
    Each page shows the same data through <code>ISyncCollection&lt;Note&gt;</code>. On the server (static SSR,
    Interactive Server, prerendering) it reads and writes the authority directly; in WebAssembly it uses a local
    IndexedDB replica that works offline and syncs over HTTP.
</p>
